    "Condition : 1 - The proposed roof extension by virtue of its design and size would have an adverse effect on the character and appearance of the dwelling, the pair of houses, the street scene and the character and appearance of The Spring Grove Conservation Area. It would also be an overbearing feature detrimental to the amenities of the surrounding occupiers. It would thereby be contrary to Policies ENV.1.1, ENV.1.2 and H.3.4 of the Adopted Unitary Development Plan (1996), Policies ENV-B.1.1, ENV-B.2.2 and H.6.4 of the Proposed Alterations Revised Deposit (2001) and Revised House Extensions Guidelines (2002)."
